<item><title>Lomé airport company lights fence for UNICEF children’s rights campaign</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/lome-airport-company-lights-fence-for-unicef-children-s-bcf80f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/lome-airport-company-lights-fence-for-unicef-children-s-bcf80f/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The display opened activities for World Children’s Day 2026 and UNICEF’s 80th anniversary, with further awareness work planned around the airport.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:36:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" length="29610" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
